# Dialogue for KD-001, one utterance per line: <speaker>TAB<vocalised text>.
# Fully vocalised on purpose - an unvowelled Arabic word is ambiguous and the
# engine will guess. Proper nouns end in sukoon with no tanwin.
# 23 words in total, about 12 seconds spoken, against 41 seconds of video:
# the rest is picture and deliberate silence, which is what the strongest
# reference does when it gives a third of its runtime to one face.

noor	هٰذَا كُوبُ جَدَّتِي!
noor	سَأُحْضِرُ المَاءَ!
samsam	أَزْرَقُ… جَمِيلٌ.
noor	كُوبِي؟ أَيْنَ كُوبِي؟
samsam	أَنَا… أَنَا أَسْقَطْتُهُ.
noor	قُلْتَ الحَقِيقَةَ.
samsam	وَمَاذَا نَفْعَلُ بِالقِطَعِ؟
